<style id="strategiq-split-text-content-style">.block-split-text-content{padding-top:calc(1.325rem + .9vw);padding-bottom:calc(1.375rem + 1.5vw)}@media (min-width: 1200px){.block-split-text-content{padding-top:2rem}}@media (min-width: 1200px){.block-split-text-content{padding-bottom:2.5rem}}@media (min-width: 768px){.block-split-text-content{padding-top:calc(1.6875rem + 5.25vw);padding-bottom:calc(1.925rem + 8.1vw)}}@media (min-width: 768px) and (min-width: 1200px){.block-split-text-content{padding-top:5.625rem}}@media (min-width: 768px) and (min-width: 1200px){.block-split-text-content{padding-bottom:8rem}}.block-split-text-content .container .container{padding-right:0;padding-left:0}.block-split-text-content .heading{font-size:24px;line-height:1.15}@media only screen and (min-width: 320px){.block-split-text-content .heading{font-size:calc( 24px + 8 * (100vw - 320px) / (1440 - 320))}}@media only screen and (min-width: 1440px){.block-split-text-content .heading{font-size:32px}}@media (min-width: 768px){.block-split-text-content.title-content .row+.row{-webkit-box-pack:end;-ms-flex-pack:end;justify-content:flex-end}}@media (min-width: 768px){.block-split-text-content.stacked .content-row{-webkit-box-align:center;-ms-flex-align:center;align-items:center;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;-webkit-box-direction:normal;-ms-flex-direction:column;flex-direction:column}}@media (min-width: 768px){.block-split-text-content.content-title .content-row{-webkit-box-orient:horizontal;-webkit-box-direction:reverse;-ms-flex-direction:row-reverse;flex-direction:row-reverse}}.block-split-text-content .content-row{-webkit-box-pack:justify;-ms-flex-pack:justify;justify-content:space-between}

/*# sourceMappingURL=block-split-text-content.css.map */
</style>
<section class="block-split-text-content title-content has-no-background wp-block-strategiq-split-text-content">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row content-row">
						<div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-5">
							<h2 class="heading heading" >From New York to London, from Beirut to Bangkok, our teams around the world strive for excellence, inside and outside the newsroom.</h2>						</div>

						
						<div class="col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-5">
							<div class="content-container" data-dsap>
								<p>Our journalists go to great lengths, often overcoming tremendous obstacles, to report the news quickly, accurately and honestly, with the utmost attention paid to AP&#8217;s high standards.</p>
<p>Outside the newsroom, our teams provide outstanding service, with a focus on customer care, ensuring AP meets the needs of our diverse client base.</p>
							</div>
						</div>

											</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>




<section class="block-title-two-column no-border has-no-background wp-block-strategiq-title-two-column">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="row">
			<div class="col-12 col-md-10 offset-md-1">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row heading-row">
						<div class="col-12">
							<h2 class="heading heading"  data-dsap>LEADERSHIP TEAM</h2>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="row content-row">
						<div class="col-12 col-md-6">
							<div class="content-container" data-dsap>
								<p>As an independent, not-for-profit news cooperative, our U.S. newspaper members elect a board of directors to provide corporate direction according to AP bylaws.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
						<div class="col-12 col-md-6">
							<div class="content-container" data-dsap>
								<p>Within AP, the senior managers who oversee our essential operations make up The Associated Press Executive Leadership Team. This team meets regularly to make policy and business decisions that keep us at the forefront of accurate and trustworthy global journalism.</p>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>




